 '',
 f"Resource samples={len(samples)}; measured intersample elapsed range{min(gaps):.6f}–{max(gaps):.6f}s, active-clock maximum{max(active):.6f}s. The implementation requests a5s sleep between samples; actual cadence includes resource-inspection/OS overhead and is not a hard5s real-time bound. This is a disclosed monitoring-cadence deviation from the protocol's nominal<=5s wording; exact completed-worker high-water RSS independently verifies the memory cap. No deadline, memory or disk allowance was enlarged. Continuous-minus-uptime offset growth over sampling={offset_growth:.6f}s; no deliberate physical sleep test or wake-time guarantee. Any natural pause consumes the original budget; boot/API failures fail closed. See resource_samples.jsonl and final resource verification for actual timing and storage.",
